OL,3,A'Not only did I survive, I thrived' -
OL,4,AMeera Syal
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn her new memoir, Vigilauntie, which
OL,7,Fwas published on Thursday, the actress
OL,8,Fshared that both incidents happened in
OL,9,Fher 20s, as she was struggling to
OL,10,Fsecure a role.
OL,12,FNow aged 65, she has opened up about
OL,13,Fthe harrowing experiences and reflected
OL,14,Fon how she overcame them to become one
OL,15,Fof the most well-known faces on British
OL,16,FTV.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
